{{Quote|Keep away from the Sinking Fields in the north. You'll drown in the sand.|Rey to BB-8|<ref name="TFA" />}}
The '''Sinking Fields''' were an area of the [[Goazon Badlands]] on [[Jakku]]. They were located north of [[Niima Outpost]] and [[Rey Skywalker|Rey's]] [[All Terrain Armored Transport|AT-AT]] [[Hellhound Two|home]]. They were the site of a crash landing by [[Poe Dameron]] and [[Finn|FN-2187]] in a [[TIE/sf space superiority fighter|Special Forces TIE fighter]] after [[Escape from the Finalizer|escaping]] the [[First Order]]'s [[flagship]] ''[[Finalizer]]''. Soon after impact, the fields swallowed the TIE fighter whole to the horror of Finn. The former [[First Order stormtrooper|stormtrooper]] walked across the fields to Niima Outpost where he encountered Rey and Dameron's missing [[BB-series astromech droid|BB unit]] [[BB-8]].<ref name="TFA" />

Previously, Rey had also warned BB-8 not to traverse the Sinking Fields, but the [[droid]] had already decided that it would stay with her.<ref name="TFA" />

